# Draft: vcomp: Implement 64-bit dynamic loop helpers and handle flag 0x20
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/12689 state=opened
# Implements the 64-bit dynamic loop scheduling helpers (`_vcomp_for_dynamic_init_i8` and `_vcomp_for_dynamic_next_i8`) in vcomp and adds handling for the `0x20` (`VCOMP_DYNAMIC_FLAGS_DYNAMIC`) flag emitted by MSVC.

Without handling flag `0x20`, chunked dynamic loops fall back to guided scheduling. Spec entries are forwarded for vcomp90 and exported locally for vcomp100 through vcomp140 to preserve per-DLL TLS task state. Conformance tests included.
